      "writtenOn": "2013-08-06T15:16:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For persistent state within a file, yes.\n\nFor constant data (such as the GPIO list in board.c), yes.\n\nTo pass information between files, no.\n\nSo\n static yes\n const yes\n neither static nor const, no.",
      "parentUuid": "AAAAcn//4Ho\u003d",
      "revId": "cf9a65003fe24212ff4500b9ee7436be0038e1bd",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
